      "n": "#188·29",
      "text": "This black knit dress features a high neckline, long sleeves, and a slim silhouette that falls to your mid-calf, offering a clean, modern line perfect for evening."
    },
    {
      "n": "#406·40",
      "text": "A smooth black leather belt with a simple rectangular buckle slides effortlessly around your waist, providing structure without adding bulk."
    },
    {
      "n": "#420·10",
      "text": "Soft black suede ankle boots sit on a thick platform sole, combining cozy warmth with an elevated, stylish edge for dancing through the night."
    },
    {
      "n": "#234·35",
      "text": "Classic gold ball studs offer subtle shine at your ears, complementing your warm skin tone and adding a touch of effortless elegance."
    },
    {
      "n": "#404·35",
